      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is injected **into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. The key is not held in the Hub\u0027s own process environment at all \u2014 instead, a local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.\n\nThe same pattern applies to the Query agent: it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, never inherited from or stored in the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
